# ---- Ferramentas que os scripts do andrey-os-base chamam (com --apt-recommends false nada disso vem sozinho)
# dconf-cli: andrey-keys/session-setup (lista e limpa atalhos)   mate-utils: mate-screenshot (Print, Super+Shift+S)
# xdg-user-dirs/xdg-utils: pasta Modelos e andrey-lock   psmisc: killall (recarga dos paineis)
# libxtst6: andrey-superkey (XRecord) e andrey-clipboard (colar com XTest)
dconf-cli
mate-utils
xdg-user-dirs
xdg-utils
psmisc
libxtst6

